WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.440
At 7:42, a customer calls.

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:03.724
The shop is closed.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.020
The phone rings. Nobody
answers.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.300
ZeroHand catches that call.

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.020
It texts the customer back,

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.420
asks what they need,

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:12.980
and helps get the job booked.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:15.300
Estimate follow-up stays within

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.720
the rules you approve.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.340
And every Monday, one receipt
shows

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.180
the replies, bookings,

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.400
and anything that still needs
you.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:24.660
Grow the shop.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.380
Not the back office.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.060
ZeroHand Labs.
